---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageMasthead from "../components/PageMasthead.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Sale & Website Use | Racquet Habit"
  description="Read the terms governing Racquet Habit website use, product orders, payment, fulfillment, cancellations, intellectual property and customer support."
>
  <PageMasthead
    title="Terms of sale & site use"
    intro="These terms describe the relationship between the Racquet Habit editorial storefront and the Fourthwall checkout used for current product orders."
    issue="Site terms · Effective 23 July 2026"
  />

  <article class="policy-page">
    <aside><span>Website & current catalog</span><span>Last updated 23 July 2026</span><span>Read before ordering</span></aside>
    <div>
      <section><h2>1. The storefront</h2><p>Racquet Habit presents the brand, collection and live product information. Current orders are completed on Fourthwall, which provides checkout, payment processing, taxes, production, fulfillment and customer support for those orders.</p></section>
      <section><h2>2. Products, options and pricing</h2><p>Live product names, variants, availability and USD prices are supplied by Fourthwall. Approximate AMD values are displayed for convenience and may differ from the final conversion used by your payment provider. Check the final product, size, color, device, quantity, delivery charge, taxes and total at checkout.</p></section>
      <section><h2>3. Order acceptance and payment</h2><p>Submitting checkout information does not create an accepted order until Fourthwall confirms it. Payment methods and receipts are provided by Fourthwall. Fourthwall may decline or cancel an order under its fraud, availability or service rules.</p></section>
      <section><h2>4. Made-to-order production</h2><p>Current products are made after ordering. Production and delivery estimates shown at checkout are estimates, not guaranteed appointment times. Use the confirmation-email link promptly if an address, size or option needs correction; changes may not be possible after production begins.</p></section>
      <section><h2>5. Delivery, quality and returns</h2><p>Delivery charges and timing are calculated at checkout. Destination duties may apply. Visible print or manufacturing issues are covered by Fourthwall’s quality guarantee after review. Because current products are made to order, general, exchange and sizing-related returns are not accepted. The delivery and returns page forms part of these terms.</p></section>
      <section><h2>6. Site content and intellectual property</h2><p>Racquet Habit names, marks, photographs, graphics, copy and page designs may not be reproduced, sold or presented as your own without written permission. You may link to public pages and share ordinary screenshots for personal commentary with attribution.</p></section>
      <section><h2>7. Accuracy and availability</h2><p>We work to keep the storefront accurate, but live supplier data, prices and availability can change. If this site and the Fourthwall checkout differ, review the checkout information before payment and contact us before ordering if the difference is material.</p></section>
      <section><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>Use Fourthwall support for an existing order and the Racquet Habit contact page for product, licensing, press or website questions.</p></section>
      <a class="paper-button" href="/contact">Contact the service desk <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
